      "cliffhanger": "Juliana declaring 'Then let it be' after being warned that refusal proves she knowingly practiced witchcraft.",
      "why": "Creates intense moral conflict between the protagonist's truth and the antagonist's power, ending on a defiant acceptance of fate.",
      "context_gap": "None; the stakes are clear: life or death based on her refusal to renounce healing."
    },
    {
      "title": "Final Judgment Threat",
      "start_block": "B114",
      "end_block": "B116",
      "hook": "The Judge stands formally to deliver a solemn judgment against Lady Juliana Ashcroft.",
      "cliffhanger": "The Judge extends his raised hand in judgment over the unbroken defendant as the scene fades.",
      "why": "Uses the ultimate authority figure to create maximum tension right before the verdict is spoken, forcing the viewer to install to see the result.",
      "context_gap": "None; the viewer knows she is on trial and the judge is about to sentence her."
    }
